mical deoxidation with DeoxIT, contact ultrasonic cleaning, or potentiometer replacement.","title":"Scratchy sound when turning volume/tone knobs, channel drops out"},{"body":"Aged electrolytic power supply filter capacitors drying out and losing capacitance. Power supply recapping with audio-grade low-ESR capacitors and bridge rectifier testing.","title":"Loud 50Hz/60Hz mains hum from speakers even at zero volume"},{"body":"Blown output transistors causing dangerous DC offset voltage at speaker terminals. Output stage transistor matching, emitter resistor replacement, and bias current calibration.","title":"Amplifier enters protection mode immediately on power-up"},{"body":"Perished foam speaker surrounds (foam rot) or rubbing voice coil. Speaker refoaming, voice coil centering, and dust cap re-gluing.","title":"Speaker sound distorted, buzzing on bass notes"},{"body":"Stretched rubber drive belt, dried motor bearing oil, or misaligned cartridge tracking force. Belt replacement, motor spindle lubrication, and precision stylus tracking alignment.","title":"Turntable speed unstable (wow & flutter) or tonearm skips"}],"title":"Common Symptoms & Technical Causes","columns":3},{"html":"<h2>Realistic Repair Costs & Benchmark Pricing</h2>\n<p>The price table below provides verified industry benchmarks for common audio equipment repairs. Use these figures to evaluate repair quotes accurately.</p>\n<p>Bench costs in Bengaluru typically reflect standardized regional component pricing and skilled technician labor rates.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Fault / Symptom</th><th>Typical Cost Range</th><th>Bench Turnaround</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td><strong>Scratchy sound when turning volume/tone knobs, channel drops out</strong></td><td>$50–$120</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Loud 50Hz/60Hz mains hum from speakers even at zero volume</strong></td><td>$90–$280</td><td>1–2 weeks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Amplifier enters protection mode immediately on power-up</strong></td><td>$120–$350</td><td>1–3 weeks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Speaker sound distorted, buzzing on bass notes</strong></td><td>$60–$160</td><td>3–7 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Turntable speed unstable (wow &amp; flutter) or tonearm skips</strong></td><td>$55–$140</td><td>2–5 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Keep original audio cables and power supplies with the unit</li><li>Lock turntable tonearms and remove counterweights and dust covers before transport</li><li>Note speaker impedance (4Ω, 8Ω) if troubleshooting amplifier output issues</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for audio equipment","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Bengaluru</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your audio equipment with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $60–$380, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does audio & hi-fi equipment repair typically cost in Bengaluru?"},{"answer":"Dust and oxidation on potentiometer carbon tracks and switch contacts. Precision chemical deoxidation with DeoxIT, contact ultrasonic cleaning, or potentiometer replacement. Expect typical costs around $50–$120 with turnaround of 1–3 days.","question":"How is ''Scratchy sound when turning volume/tone knobs, channel drops out'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within 3 days to 3 weeks. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Bengaluru?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when proprietary DSP chips or custom transformers are permanently unavailable and cannot be substituted.","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=audio-equipment&q=Bengaluru","label":"Search verified shops in Bengaluru"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Bengaluru with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_banner","heading":"Find verified audio & hi-fi equipment experts in Bengaluru"}]'::jsonb,
