 anchor reinforcement.","title":"HDMI port damaged, pins bent, no display signal on TV"},{"body":"Dust clogging heatsink exhaust fins and oxidized/displaced thermal interface (e.g. liquid metal / paste). Deep internal teardown, ultrasonic heatsink wash, fan bearing lubrication, and thermal barrier re-application.","title":"Console turns off suddenly after 15 minutes of 4K gaming with overheating message"},{"body":"Worn drive belt, jammed loading gears, or laser lens optic laser diode degradation. Disc drive laser carriage replacement and gear alignment.","title":"Optical disc drive will not take discs, ejects immediately, or cannot read games"},{"body":"Worn carbon potentiometer tracks inside analog joystick module. Desoldering old modules and installing magnetic Hall-Effect anti-drift joysticks.","title":"Controller analog stick drifts without touching (Stick Drift)"},{"body":"Corrupted internal SSD/HDD or damaged power management IC. Firmware reinitialization, internal drive replacement, and file system recovery.","title":"Console stuck in boot loop or storage corruption error code"}],"title":"Common Symptoms & Technical Causes","columns":3},{"html":"<h2>Realistic Repair Costs & Benchmark Pricing</h2>\n<p>The price table below provides verified industry benchmarks for common game consoles repairs. Use these figures to evaluate repair quotes accurately.</p>\n<p>Bench costs in Mumbai typically reflect standardized regional component pricing and skilled technician labor rates.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Fault / Symptom</th><th>Typical Cost Range</th><th>Bench Turnaround</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td><strong>HDMI port damaged, pins bent, no display signal on TV</strong></td><td>$75–$140</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Console turns off suddenly after 15 minutes of 4K gaming with overheating message</strong></td><td>$60–$120</td><td>1 day</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Optical disc drive will not take discs, ejects immediately, or cannot read games</strong></td><td>$65–$130</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Controller analog stick drifts without touching (Stick Drift)</strong></td><td>$35–$65</td><td>same day to 1 day</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Console stuck in boot loop or storage corruption error code</strong></td><td>$60–$150</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Sync game saves to cloud services (PlayStation Plus, Xbox Live, Nintendo Online)</li><li>Remove any game discs from optical drives before transport</li><li>Bring the power cable and one synced controller</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for game consoles","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Mumbai</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your game consoles with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $50–$210, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does gaming console repair typically cost in Mumbai?"},{"answer":"Cable pulled at an angle, dropping console while plugged in, breaking internal HDMI pins. Micro-soldering replacement of HDMI 2.1 port with solid ground anchor reinforcement. Expect typical costs around $75–$140 with turnaround of 1–2 days.","question":"How is ''HDMI port damaged, pins bent, no display signal on TV'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within 1–3 days. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Mumbai?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when the main custom APU processor has suffered internal silicon failure (e.g. fatal silicon bridge defect).","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=consoles&q=Mumbai","label":"Search verified shops in Mumbai"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Mumbai with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_banner","heading":"Find verified gaming console experts in Mumbai"}]'::jsonb,
