with multimeter, bench power load test, and PSU / motherboard replacement.","title":"PC will not turn on, no LEDs, no fan spin"},{"body":"Defective RAM memory modules, failing GPU VRAM, or corrupted storage drive sectors. MemTest86 memory diagnostic, SSD SMART health analysis, and faulty module replacement.","title":"Random Blue Screen of Death (BSOD), crashes during games or rendering"},{"body":"AIO liquid cooler pump failure, air bubbles in block, or dry thermal compound. Cooler replacement, radiator fin cleaning, and premium thermal paste application.","title":"Loud grinding fan noise, CPU overheating and throttling"},{"body":"Failing mechanical hard drive or degraded NAND flash controller on M.2 NVMe SSD. Sector-by-sector drive cloning to modern NVMe SSD without data loss.","title":"Slow boot times, freezing when opening folders"},{"body":"Loose PCIe slot connection, failing GPU power stages, or corrupted motherboard BIOS. CMOS battery reset, BIOS flashback, and PCIe slot micro-soldering inspection.","title":"No video signal to monitor, GPU fans spinning at maximum speed"}],"title":"Common Symptoms & Technical Causes","columns":3},{"html":"<h2>Realistic Repair Costs & Benchmark Pricing</h2>\n<p>The price table below provides verified industry benchmarks for common desktop computers repairs. Use these figures to evaluate repair quotes accurately.</p>\n<p>Bench costs in Delhi typically reflect standardized regional component pricing and skilled technician labor rates.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Fault / Symptom</th><th>Typical Cost Range</th><th>Bench Turnaround</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td><strong>PC will not turn on, no LEDs, no fan spin</strong></td><td>$70–$180</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Random Blue Screen of Death (BSOD), crashes during games or rendering</strong></td><td>$60–$160</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Loud grinding fan noise, CPU overheating and throttling</strong></td><td>$65–$190</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Slow boot times, freezing when opening folders</strong></td><td>$90–$250</td><td>1 day</td></tr><tr><td><strong>No video signal to monitor, GPU fans spinning at maximum speed</strong></td><td>$70–$220</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Back up critical work and personal files to an external drive or cloud</li><li>Only bring the desktop tower; cables, monitors, and mice are generally not required unless requested</li><li>Provide system login credentials for post-repair stress testing</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for desktop computers","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Delhi</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your desktop computers with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $60–$350, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does desktop pc & workstation repair typically cost in Delhi?"},{"answer":"Blown Power Supply Unit (PSU), tripped surge protection, or shorted motherboard VRM. PSU rail testing with multimeter, bench power load test, and PSU / motherboard replacement. Expect typical costs around $70–$180 with turnaround of 1–2 days.","question":"How is ''PC will not turn on, no LEDs, no fan spin'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within 1–4 days. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Delhi?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when core architectural standards (DDR generation, CPU socket) are obsolete and the diagnostic points to multi-component failure.","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=desktops&q=Delhi","label":"Search verified shops in Delhi"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Delhi with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_banner","heading":"Find verified desktop pc & workstation experts in Delhi"}]'::jsonb,
