 fin de-felting, fan bearing lubrication, and application of high-conductivity thermal paste or phase-change pads.","title":"Loud blower fan, chassis hot to touch, CPU thermal throttling"},{"body":"Beverage spill residues inside membrane switches or mechanical scissor-switch clip fatigue. Keyboard assembly replacement. On modern ultrabooks, this involves riveting or replacing the entire palmrest top case.","title":"Sticky, repeating, or non-responsive keyboard keys"},{"body":"Physical impact cracking the TFT glass substrate or damaged low-voltage differential signaling (eDP) flex cables. Display panel extraction, bezel adhesive restoration, and eDP connector seating.","title":"Cracked screen or vertical colored lines across panel"},{"body":"Shorted input MOSFETs, blown surface-mount ceramic filtering capacitors, or worn DC power barrel jack / USB-C PD controller. Board-level micro-soldering diagnostics using thermal imaging and bench power supplies, followed by component-level replacement.","title":"No power, no charging LED, dead machine"},{"body":"High hinge torque fatiguing brass threaded inserts embedded in structural polycarbonate frame plastics. Hinge replacement, structural epoxy rebuilding of anchor standoffs, and torque loosening to prevent recurrence.","title":"Display hinge separating or cracking bottom housing"}],"title":"Common Symptoms & Technical Causes","columns":3},{"html":"<h2>Realistic Repair Costs & Benchmark Pricing</h2>\n<p>The price table below provides verified industry benchmarks for common laptops repairs. Use these figures to evaluate repair quotes accurately.</p>\n<p>Bench costs in Delhi typically reflect standardized regional component pricing and skilled technician labor rates.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Fault / Symptom</th><th>Typical Cost Range</th><th>Bench Turnaround</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td><strong>Loud blower fan, chassis hot to touch, CPU thermal throttling</strong></td><td>$70–$130</td><td>2–4 hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sticky, repeating, or non-responsive keyboard keys</strong></td><td>$90–$260</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cracked screen or vertical colored lines across panel</strong></td><td>$120–$320</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>No power, no charging LED, dead machine</strong></td><td>$120–$420</td><td>3–6 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display hinge separating or cracking bottom housing</strong></td><td>$110–$260</td><td>2–4 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Create a full system backup (Time Machine, File History, or clone disk) prior to service</li><li>Include the AC power adapter / OEM charging brick to verify charging circuits</li><li>Provide administrative credentials or set up a temporary local technician account</li><li>Disable BitLocker / FileVault drive encryption or keep recovery keys accessible</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for laptops","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Delhi</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your laptops with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $70–$420, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does laptop repair typically cost in Delhi?"},{"answer":"Fibrous dust accumulation blocking radiator fin stacks combined with factory thermal paste pump-out and dry-out. Complete thermal overhaul: heatsink fin de-felting, fan bearing lubrication, and application of high-conductivity thermal paste or phase-change pads. Expect typical costs around $70–$130 with turnaround of 2–4 hours.","question":"How is ''Loud blower fan, chassis hot to touch, CPU thermal throttling'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within 1–5 days. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Delhi?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when the mainboard has suffered severe liquid or power-rail failure on a machine over six years old, where a replacement board exceeds current market valuation.","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=laptops&q=Delhi","label":"Search verified shops in Delhi"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Delhi with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_banner","heading":"Find verified laptop experts in Delhi"}]'::jsonb,
  '2026-09-09T19:36:42.894+00:00',
  now()
)
