day</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Apple Pencil / stylus not tracking or recognizing pressure</strong></td><td>$80–$180</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Back up tablet to cloud storage or local computer</li><li>Disable activation lock and passcode if sending in for service</li><li>Remove third-party cases and magnetic keyboard covers</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for tablets","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Bengaluru</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your tablets with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $60–$290, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does tablet & ipad repair typically cost in Bengaluru?"},{"answer":"Drop impact cracking the glass digitizer or laminated Liquid Retina display. Display and digitizer assembly replacement using precision heat bed separation and OEM adhesive gaskets. Expect typical costs around $90–$260 with turnaround of 1–2 days.","question":"How is ''Shattered front glass, touch digitizer unresponsive'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within same day to 3 days. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Bengaluru?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when the main logic board has suffered catastrophic multi-layer fracture or processor failure on older generation devices.","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=tablets&q=Bengaluru","label":"Search verified shops in Bengaluru"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Bengaluru with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_