ect-lit arrays. Panel disassembly and complete replacement of LED backlight array strips with aluminum-backed bars.","title":"TV has sound and responds to remote, but screen is completely dark (flashlight reveals faint image)"},{"body":"Blown power supply board (PSU) electrolytic capacitors, bridge rectifiers, or standby regulators. Component-level power board repair or complete power supply board replacement.","title":"TV will not turn on, power LED clicks or flashes error codes"},{"body":"T-Con (Timing Controller) board failure or oxidized flat flex cables. T-Con board replacement and ribbon cable cleaning.","title":"Horizontal lines, color banding, or half the screen distorted"},{"body":"Corrupted eMMC flash memory IC on mainboard. Mainboard eMMC chip reflashing or mainboard replacement.","title":"Smart TV reboots constantly on brand logo (bootloop)"},{"body":"HDMI switch IC failure from static discharge or lightning surge. Micro-soldering HDMI controller IC replacement on the main processing board.","title":"HDMI ports not detecting cable inputs or no audio"}],"title":"Common Symptoms & Technical Causes","columns":3},{"html":"<h2>Realistic Repair Costs & Benchmark Pricing</h2>\n<p>The price table below provides verified industry benchmarks for common televisions and monitors repairs. Use these figures to evaluate repair quotes accurately.</p>\n<p>Bench costs in Mumbai typically reflect standardized regional component pricing and skilled technician labor rates.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Fault / Symptom</th><th>Typical Cost Range</th><th>Bench Turnaround</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td><strong>TV has sound and responds to remote, but screen is completely dark (flashlight reveals faint image)</strong></td><td>$90–$220</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>TV will not turn on, power LED clicks or flashes error codes</strong></td><td>$80–$190</td><td>1–3 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Horizontal lines, color banding, or half the screen distorted</strong></td><td>$70–$160</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart TV reboots constantly on brand logo (bootloop)</strong></td><td>$85–$210</td><td>2–4 days</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI ports not detecting cable inputs or no audio</strong></td><td>$90–$195</td><td>2–4 days</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Factors That Influence Repair Quotes</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Component Quality & Origin:</strong> Genuine OEM parts, certified refurbished original modules, and aftermarket grades differ in cost, color calibration, and durability. Always ask your technician which component tier is quoted.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Component-Level Diagnosis:</strong> Technicians who diagnose and micro-solder specific failed resistors, capacitors, or ports save you significant money compared to shops that simply swap out entire expensive sub-assemblies.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"body":"<ul><li>Transport TV upright or supported flat on a clean blanket—never lay face-down on hard surfaces</li><li>Bring the original TV remote control</li><li>Take a clear photo of the model sticker on the rear cabinet</li></ul>","side":"right","type":"text_image","image":{"alt":"A certified repair technician bench prepared for televisions and monitors","src":"/images/bench.jpg"},"heading":"Preparation Checklist Before Drop-Off"},{"html":"<h2>How to Choose a Reputable Local Repair Shop across Mumbai</h2>\n<p>Before leaving your televisions and monitors with a repair shop, ask these four critical questions:</p>\n<h3>1. What warranty do you provide on parts and labor?</h3>\n<p>Reputable independent repair shops typically offer a 90-day to 1-year written warranty covering both replacement components and bench labor.</p>\n<h3>2. Do you perform diagnostics before charging?</h3>\n<p>Clear diagnostic estimates ensure you are never surprised by unexpected fees. Ask whether initial bench assessment fees apply toward the final repair cost.</p>\n<h3>3. What is your data security policy?</h3>\n<p>For electronic devices storing personal information, ensure the shop has strict confidentiality protocols, does not require unnecessary passwords, and never wipes storage drives without your prior authorization.</p>\n<h3>4. Are turnaround estimates realistic?</h3>\n<p>Confirm whether common parts are on the shelf or need to be ordered, so you have an accurate timeline for pickup.</p>","type":"rich_text","width":"prose"},{"type":"faq_accordion","items":[{"answer":"Most standard repairs range between $70–$320, depending on component availability and whether the fault is a modular replacement or micro-soldering.","question":"How much does tv & monitor display repair typically cost in Mumbai?"},{"answer":"Failed LED backlight strips (open-circuit LED beads) in edge-lit or direct-lit arrays. Panel disassembly and complete replacement of LED backlight array strips with aluminum-backed bars. Expect typical costs around $90–$220 with turnaround of 1–3 days.","question":"How is ''TV has sound and responds to remote, but screen is completely dark (flashlight reveals faint image)'' fixed?"},{"answer":"Most jobs are completed within 1–5 days. In-stock modular repairs are frequently finished the same day.","question":"How long will the repair take in Mumbai?"},{"answer":"Consider replacement when the LCD/OLED glass panel itself has physical impact cracks, as replacement panels typically equal 90% of new TV retail price.","question":"When should I replace rather than repair?"},{"answer":"Under Right to Repair laws in many jurisdictions, third-party repairs do not void manufacturer warranties unless the repair itself directly causes damage to other components.","question":"Does third-party repair void my manufacturer warranty?"},{"answer":"While many shops accept walk-ins, calling ahead or booking online ensures replacement parts are reserved and technician bench time is scheduled immediately.","question":"Do I need to book an appointment in advance?"}],"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"cta":{"href":"/search?category=televisions&q=Mumbai","label":"Search verified shops in Mumbai"},"body":"Browse local repair shops in Mumbai with verified bench tools, transparent pricing, and 90-day warranty coverage.","tone":"signal","type":"cta_banner","heading":"Find verified tv & monitor display experts in Mumbai"}]'::jsonb,
